{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is best described in 25 words: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a sci-fi roguelike auto battler where you command an intergalactic carrier, outfitting it with new spacecraft and technologies to take on other players asynchronously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If I were forced to use more words and gifs then I'd probably say something like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/shop_5.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your Carrier with a wide array of deadly spaceships and weird and wonderful technology designed to obliterate anyone stupid enough to oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The position of cargo items can both trigger awesome combos with other cargo or combine to create entirely new technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique items means, billions of combinations - and we\u2019ve tested them all\u2026.honest, don\u2019t look into it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/placement.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage opposing commanders in asynchronous multiplayer - because nobody wants to actually talk to other people online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/async_multiplayer.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not the size of your deck that matters, it\u2019s also the shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire Crew to uncover derelict areas of your Carrier, who knows what tech you might reveal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then put them to work flying your starships, ensuring they stay on target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/Steam_Banner_01_prosper.png?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in real life, if you can emerge victorious 10 times before tasting defeat 3 times then you are crowned \u201cawesome and better than 10 other people\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, in space, no one can hear you rage-quit, but we can see your win/loss stats!</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2994150?t=1747659674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747659674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/94628a3b63177921a844db0826c178cca6664de4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747659674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/94628a3b63177921a844db0826c178cca6664de4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747659674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3186690,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is best described in 25 words: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's a sci-fi roguelike auto battler where you command an intergalactic carrier, outfitting it with new spacecraft and technologies to take on other players asynchronously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If I were forced to use more words and gifs then I'd probably say something like this:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/shop_5.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your Carrier with a wide array of deadly spaceships and weird and wonderful technology designed to obliterate anyone stupid enough to oppose you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The position of cargo items can both trigger awesome combos with other cargo or combine to create entirely new technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hundreds of unique items means, billions of combinations - and we\u2019ve tested them all\u2026.honest, don\u2019t look into it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/placement.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage opposing commanders in asynchronous multiplayer - because nobody wants to actually talk to other people online!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/async_multiplayer.gif?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not the size of your deck that matters, it\u2019s also the shape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire Crew to uncover derelict areas of your Carrier, who knows what tech you might reveal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then put them to work flying your starships, ensuring they stay on target.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/extras/Steam_Banner_01_prosper.png?t=1747659674\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just like in real life, if you can emerge victorious 10 times before tasting defeat 3 times then you are crowned \u201cawesome and better than 10 other people\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course, in space, no one can hear you rage-quit, but we can see your win/loss stats!</p>","developers":["Flaming Fowl Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2994150/header.jpg?t=1747659674","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Flaming Fowl Studios 2024. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257065467,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065467/movie480.mp4?t=1738798736","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065467/movie_max.mp4?t=1738798736"},"name":"Konfronto Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257065467/40c50a4a58965808db255b8218d6c702c4a004f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1738798736","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065467/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1738798736","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257065467/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1738798736"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257135842,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25